          <Pad Id="Otwi5I7v4jGadhGzoaYhdE" Bounds="520,423,560,45" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="TWO MOUSE NODES, ON PURPOSE. The one above is the MAP's - pixels, feeding Drag, Zoom and&#xD;&#xA;ScreenToWorld. This one is the RENDERER's - scene units, feeding the text that follows your&#xD;&#xA;cursor, and its Right Pressed is the switch. Furniture and geography do not share a space.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
