          <Pad Id="KBzmLzApNjVyNB9ga2LHL9" Bounds="500,1103,560,30" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt;- the cross is built FROM the map (ScreenToWorld) and drawn ON it, which is a genuine loop.&#xD;&#xA;FrameDelay breaks it: the layer the map gets is one frame old, which no eye can see.">
