          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="HB0iLQLG7v5xlghsoFMFln" Bounds="1400,570,660,45" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="THE READOUT - anchored to the CURSOR. Furniture, not geography: a Skia layer drawn over the&#xD;&#xA;map, in the renderer's own space, touching no projection at all. OpenLayers calls this a&#xD;&#xA;control, Mapsui calls it a widget, and no library in the field calls it a layer.">
